{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Night Swarm",
    "steam_appid": 3668370,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/b7af4c617ce504af883c39f7c19063e5.poster.avif?t=1755597285\" width=800 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/b7af4c617ce504af883c39f7c19063e5.webm?t=1755597285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Swarm is a vampire-themed roguelite RPG bullet hell where you play as a fearsome young vampire lord rising to power. Gather loyal allies, unleash devastating abilities, and fight back against the relentless werewolf hordes that threaten to consume the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/9774913be03d210921caba0945f378a0.poster.avif?t=1755597285\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/9774913be03d210921caba0945f378a0.webm?t=1755597285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient powers of the dark stand behind you, each offering unique, cursed blessings to aid your ascent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover why these shadowy forces have chosen to support you, unravel the truth behind the age-old war between vampires and werewolves, and delve into the haunted pasts of your companions as you push deeper into the cursed lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The night is yours\u2014and you are hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your swarm. Tear through the pack.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/e1d649a8112841380337b69577179a16.poster.avif?t=1755597285\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/e1d649a8112841380337b69577179a16.webm?t=1755597285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW STRONG \u2014 AND MAKE OTHERS STRONGER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your legend travel faster than your shadow, becoming a beacon of hope for those still resisting in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They await a new Vampire Lord\u2014a leader worthy of the night. That leader is you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally them to your side. Show them how to fight. And remind the world that the true terror of the night...\u00a0is\u00a0you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/069bb0ed7630e8ef2f7164fe171553a2.poster.avif?t=1755597285\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/069bb0ed7630e8ef2f7164fe171553a2.webm?t=1755597285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU HAVE WORK TO DO TONIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aid friendly creatures, uncover hidden treasures, restore the natural order, and bring balance back to the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you'll help your allies. Sometimes\u2014even your enemies. Because to truly reclaim the night, it's not enough to defeat your foes; you must also ensure your friends rise with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By guiding others to victory, you earn their trust\u2014and their aid in your fight against ancient evils. The night is a delicate web of power, and only those who understand its balance can hope to survive it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/b7af4c617ce504af883c39f7c19063e5.poster.avif?t=1755597285\" width=800 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/b7af4c617ce504af883c39f7c19063e5.webm?t=1755597285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Swarm is a vampire-themed roguelite RPG bullet hell where you play as a fearsome young vampire lord rising to power. Gather loyal allies, unleash devastating abilities, and fight back against the relentless werewolf hordes that threaten to consume the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/9774913be03d210921caba0945f378a0.poster.avif?t=1755597285\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/9774913be03d210921caba0945f378a0.webm?t=1755597285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient powers of the dark stand behind you, each offering unique, cursed blessings to aid your ascent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover why these shadowy forces have chosen to support you, unravel the truth behind the age-old war between vampires and werewolves, and delve into the haunted pasts of your companions as you push deeper into the cursed lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The night is yours\u2014and you are hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your swarm. Tear through the pack.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/e1d649a8112841380337b69577179a16.poster.avif?t=1755597285\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/e1d649a8112841380337b69577179a16.webm?t=1755597285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW STRONG \u2014 AND MAKE OTHERS STRONGER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your legend travel faster than your shadow, becoming a beacon of hope for those still resisting in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They await a new Vampire Lord\u2014a leader worthy of the night. That leader is you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally them to your side. Show them how to fight. And remind the world that the true terror of the night...\u00a0is\u00a0you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/069bb0ed7630e8ef2f7164fe171553a2.poster.avif?t=1755597285\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/069bb0ed7630e8ef2f7164fe171553a2.webm?t=1755597285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU HAVE WORK TO DO TONIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aid friendly creatures, uncover hidden treasures, restore the natural order, and bring balance back to the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you'll help your allies. Sometimes\u2014even your enemies. Because to truly reclaim the night, it's not enough to defeat your foes; you must also ensure your friends rise with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By guiding others to victory, you earn their trust\u2014and their aid in your fight against ancient evils. The night is a delicate web of power, and only those who understand its balance can hope to survive it.</p>",
    "short_description": "Rise as a young vampire, earn your name, and gather powerful allies. In this survivor-like auto-shooter, battle relentless werewolf hordes, grow your strength, build your pack, and dominate the night.",
